{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/14/afr7ho9xl1v6myemjacb2kq9j5xftc1.mp3","text":"你好，博士......没有什么，想聊的话题吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/98/dq275z2y6yus6r9at67boqovqdttzpi.mp3","text":"你的脸色很糟糕。胸口也很痛？不要逞强，请马上休息......别害怕，我就在你身边，一定会没事的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/j355uc2kwzpo4l1o813ljihmgg6q6ha.mp3","text":"我的医疗法术似乎在什么地方见过......？那是错觉，嗯，一定是......","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/02wj38gm0f9gqzysjps66z4i52pzdkz.mp3","text":"“赦罪师”......？为什么会提到这个名字......对不起，这个话题我不能继续下去......","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/rmpehnyt65ruycahim8skzaxh53wfwj.mp3","text":"我们萨卡兹人，把法术天赋和源石的力量结合在一起，开发出了能够治愈他人的源石技艺。一直以来，这种法术都被我们用来救助受难者。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/p44snhzb3fqiyn57asb2c31ov91rafn.mp3","text":"现在？现在，什么都没有了。那场战争，剥夺了我们所有的希望。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/0r58d2gaarcgqnlj75r5c5b3y6v9tn8.mp3","text":"我和临光？是啊，她是我旅途的伙伴，也是值得托付生命的人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/be7x56f02dym9gpatfogc8xcedogg8y.mp3","text":"为拯救痛苦的人们不惜牺牲自己的一切——临光那个孩子，就是这样一个人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/21p1h6vkurfggd8cf82zzus8a6laim5.mp3","text":"曾经，我追随着一位身影辉煌的人，直到那光芒在阴谋中消散。这次，这光芒，将永远绽放、永不泯灭，哪怕要用我的生命作为交换，也在所不惜......","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/675k82yzz5idif4mqj4jgfwbelavafh.mp3","text":"......这份寂静， 让我想起了身在故乡时的岁月。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/m1m4j2u5p6hkc002d1o3plcem7u2ltp.mp3","text":"巡回医师闪灵。你在哪里见过我吗？或许在旅途中，我们也曾擦肩而过。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/0na3f7iq4jijszxizb88xifkkyawqxl.mp3","text":"只是用于愈合伤口的力量，是不够的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/mqa8nh5bhfnmxuamqg47ofx098737ij.mp3","text":"单单作为医者，是无法拯救更多人的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/de2stnz94o710i85srcuxgx1xd60u5u.mp3","text":"是的，不仅要作为医者，更是作为守护者而生存下去，长久以来，我一直将此作为目标。博士，聆听吧......请你，见证我的誓言。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/py8movy7bo9r0m2o9zquyxssl5w8lgl.mp3","text":"该前往战场了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/km4bawy3y9vzd7bij7ilimsvdi803qc.mp3","text":"这是为了拯救我们自己而战，对吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/kaxvsrv05nh4cudw2q3o0gsmbndjtrf.mp3","text":"战争，无法逃避。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/evys6yqqp9xeve4e24xcu9xlch30s1p.mp3","text":"能从战斗中寻得拯救......吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/ejp19to7y8pomrnl7inuofsvd3jtknd.mp3","text":"开始吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/5pq6cm5or5m7b4w3fecj81bjh7nz71n.mp3","text":"是的，我在听。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/iil6pqhy17g1z3gvyw3gwq3mvnxv5g0.mp3","text":"无论繁荣，还是灭亡。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/29opy5qwmip032xyvx62h25h80nrtif.mp3","text":"只是一瞬间而已。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/qe3ai4tjcs9rz9291yauhju6jfogqdy.mp3","text":"你，由我来守护。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/06/9jkip9nrrwyq6sqgrketgy0p0842x1t.mp3","text":"别担心。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/on53rj7n78jv1nnm2rsw1qbmrwafeis.mp3","text":"如此的......悲伤。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/e4bz6e3msnwg2upac42kqyx4iaxk4s9.mp3","text":"痛苦，我从未忘记。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/88xusqtjodx9om6amo5egwqgmcqdjd4.mp3","text":"敌人愈是强大，愈是能鼓舞我们的生命意志和战斗精神。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/6lsdbo6fhrvo0wjowvdod7osw4xiokr.mp3","text":"无论罪业多少次往复，都会与生命一同化为尘土。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/ltma1vse5oqxrfmjh3jwbzj7bzs9rct.mp3","text":"不要再回到战场上了，这里没有救赎。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/7flcvsyd88fsuuvrcblyup6g0l8tg27.mp3","text":"胜利，失败......只不过是无限循环的一瞬。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/r36vdao1tz73rctlx4gi3r2iupt0khv.mp3","text":"让我待在安静的地方就可以了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/djvt054ixjsytft298pw3473ibp6w38.mp3","text":"怎么了？","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/mkl2dorizr345rhw772n409s3hqmwrx.mp3","text":"我的心情很久没这样平静过了，甚至连您的心跳，我也听得见。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:9/91/ghf6djsbw4qkarckdzzc40dmyl84hve.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/ad3tcungze7cydy3myt2ae6duzbsxzi.mp3","text":"烟花......很好看。曾经只是埋头研究，与死亡对抗，徘徊在战场的我，现在竟能有一刻的闲暇去遥望夜空......生命的起伏，真是令人难以预料。","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/53ksc7v8me1vcumpp34lqtas63xxy75.mp3","text":"博士，今天的感觉怎么样？","alt":"voice_cn/char_147_shining/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/oz92gn0gyistgxj7xlhn0mmn7txd3jd.mp3","text":"你好，博士......没有什么，想聊的话题吗？","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/idmq6kqhdy4fyaxczyi5uv6ga4duf07.mp3","text":"你的脸色很糟糕。胸口也很痛？不要逞强，请马上休息......别害怕，我就在你身边，一定会没事的......","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/kphb1cpwut2tynnkpy3ueee5lnvo2j1.mp3","text":"我的医疗法术似乎在什么地方见过......？那是错觉，嗯，一定是......","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/17/ape6jksc40iynkqzlc6adhanlrzog3u.mp3","text":"“赦罪师”......？为什么会提到这个名字......对不起，这个话题我不能继续下去......","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/hw9jrmr357mtls448ewn9ivkbznbz7o.mp3","text":"我们萨卡兹人，把法术天赋和源石的力量结合在一起，开发出了能够治愈他人的源石技艺。一直以来，这种法术都被我们用来救助受难者。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/57/k4hqbcvw0admn3jr82idhr78sweclil.mp3","text":"现在？现在，什么都没有了。那场战争，剥夺了我们所有的希望。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/sj3hxrqd1rdb66fky019y9c6349jzvx.mp3","text":"我和临光？是啊，她是我旅途的伙伴，也是值得托付生命的人。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/67/jkpvhirp5ds2cit6f13fl8mi14hw6eu.mp3","text":"为拯救痛苦的人们不惜牺牲自己的一切——临光那个孩子，就是这样一个人。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/99/idj0oa30cgltlq9o8cjpfe7ohctjep9.mp3","text":"曾经，我追随着一位身影辉煌的人，直到那光芒在阴谋中消散。这次，这光芒，将永远绽放、永不泯灭，哪怕要用我的生命作为交换，也在所不惜......","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/l2rlfnqtksaq2t6bfjcd27j6q1oxvt0.mp3","text":"......这份寂静， 让我想起了身在故乡时的岁月。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/ijoh898smdqnpkaewxs9pznb2kambqx.mp3","text":"巡回医师闪灵。你在哪里见过我吗？或许在旅途中，我们也曾擦肩而过。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/02/1xst9dq3onb8n1tp3n6llde2a1oi92s.mp3","text":"只是用于愈合伤口的力量，是不够的。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/1m5sxuwoqaesz5t734wk1xawdyr8o5w.mp3","text":"单单作为医者，是无法拯救更多人的。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/qgq2uf73x27ey2ylhvdfsg3rqa0ayrq.mp3","text":"是的，不仅要作为医者，更是作为守护者而生存下去，长久以来，我一直将此作为目标。博士，聆听吧......请你，见证我的誓言。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:5/50/l63okt6wn3dowwrl04xf98bgsalb8bv.mp3","text":"该前往战场了？","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/868e2ehcztczurp5n62fhtt9jphnvtp.mp3","text":"这是为了拯救我们自己而战，对吧？","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/7jjw0acu3f0mo6ayidvy748rf884lnb.mp3","text":"战争，无法逃避。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/g52u0ia7k8saosxudz0pt7xssn2daak.mp3","text":"能从战斗中寻得拯救......吗？","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/nyzudhtlj43elvkmmefqycmimg8e1ry.mp3","text":"开始吧。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/iktod02b343h6xxxvj1tmh1uqlgbh2p.mp3","text":"是的，我在听。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/9ps258wxni1vfi47ve12fntublwibg7.mp3","text":"无论繁荣，还是灭亡。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/fykpldhmemas18amgk3crn6sho9ich7.mp3","text":"只是一瞬间而已。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/nu76l1rbn37ezvrdv1tlc6f0a6ul386.mp3","text":"你，由我来守护。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/22chdhc58yqrmm898iaj06ygxqcnytp.mp3","text":"别担心。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/blvtlg1faiqv5so13i2ammmzgcbhh9i.mp3","text":"如此的......悲伤。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/67/8fogupxrkn9mtvq5kp0xpg13pszckg4.mp3","text":"痛苦，我从未忘记。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/tathomxq0bo11guvla6m1ujzxrbhnif.mp3","text":"敌人愈是强大，愈是能鼓舞我们的生命意志和战斗精神。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/hayv5h3qut58o20n94x61rtv1aikyte.mp3","text":"无论罪业多少次往复，都会与生命一同化为尘土。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/6zefetj2201nobul0tvz9182pxb18o6.mp3","text":"不要再回到战场上了，这里没有救赎。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/eip8f9us5ltqj45jkq9h7mswedftdqm.mp3","text":"胜利，失败......只不过是无限循环的一瞬。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/ef62coxh71uzevx30rsvzz6kt7y3nlf.mp3","text":"让我待在安静的地方就可以了。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e9/r7se4d2jwaytq42qk4wh9wcryfqjhsx.mp3","text":"怎么了？","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/3uclyogxxo1j439suaiwmjl8kxxpvec.mp3","text":"我的心情很久没这样平静过了，甚至连您的心跳，我也听得见。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/eusg1o4m1oge34i79kfgox4dno83uoc.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/o9t5lqpir1iwkcq2lgi7ihvz738q3ch.mp3","text":"烟花......很好看。曾经只是埋头研究，与死亡对抗，徘徊在战场的我，现在竟能有一刻的闲暇去遥望夜空......生命的起伏，真是令人难以预料。","alt":"voice/char_147_shining/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"